            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 12, padding: 26, borderLeft: '4px solid #3B82F6' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>申请免测，只能拿 1 分</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>确有身体原因不能测的，要携带医学证明，经系党总支负责人签字以后，才可以免予测试。</Text>
