                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, background: '#FFF7ED', borderRadius: 12, padding: 26, borderLeft: '4px solid #EA580C' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>免测不等于免测这一项</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#7C2D12', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>免测少 1 分，评优评奖里那条“体测成绩合格”的条件依然对不上。真有情况，开学就把手续办清楚。</Text>
